WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.650
Your profile is in Settings, under Profile.

2
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.860
Here you can change your photo, your name, phone number and email.

3
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.530
When you're done, tap Save profile.

4
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:18.020
You can also choose the language KiddieTrac uses for you.

5
00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:25.480
Emergency contacts and pickup people are managed by the centre, so to change those, please message your director.
